ligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the Maclaurin expansion is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x{2}^{x} & =(0)+(1)x+\\frac{(2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2)}{2!}{x}^{2}+\\frac{3(\\operatorname{ln}⁡2)^{2}}{3!}{x}^{3}+⋯ \\\\  & =x+(\\operatorname{ln}⁡2){x}^{2}+\\frac{(\\operatorname{ln}⁡2)^{2}{x}^{3}}{2}+⋯.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186260086 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{1}{6}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186260086 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186260086 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "183da1c9-917b-5fdc-b6b6-17ca2b4b1566" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186260707 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{1}{2}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186260707 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186260707 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "6023af0f-b4dd-541f-b0d2-9db3f518cd70" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261013 #edb/ref 1080 "(0,5)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261013 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261013 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "8311c425-96db-50b4-bda2-7afc21298e5d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261147 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{1}{9}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261147 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261147 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "9279ff2b-bdd6-558b-b9f7-b1a54f7eb5c8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261184 #edb/ref 1080 "(10,-7)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261184 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261184 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "970d51ce-6cc7-567e-b921-0a5f575739b7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261416 #edb/ref 1080 "(6,-7)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261416 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261416 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "aed5ed6e-37c8-5e3c-ae55-c95e30ce3202" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261533 #edb/ref 1080 "(1,2)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261533 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261533 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "bc52c38c-023f-560d-827e